{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42744","headline":"秋夕书怀 二 · 刘兼","name":"秋夕书怀 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"直气从来不入时，掩关慵更钓磻溪。\n斯文未丧宣尼叹，吾道将穷阮籍悲。\n轻粉覆霜凝夜砌，乱金铺菊织秋篱。\n南阳卧久无人问，薄命非才有可疑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42744.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42744","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}